  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Humanitarian Capacity Development Programme Phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is for the evaluation of Phase 1 of the HCD programme which aims to strengthen partners capacity to prepare and respond to emergencies. The project started in 2012 and ended in December 2015. The programme is working with 15 partners in 8 countries. The evaluation includes visits to Kenya, DRC. It will be completed by March 2016.</narrative>
